  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 201.02 Applicability. These rules shall apply to all proceedings initiated under RSA 482 relative to dams and lake level determinations.\n\nSource. #1644, eff 10-7-80; ss by #2207, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2900, eff 11-7-84; ss by #5080, eff 2-22-91; ss by #6462-B, eff 2-21-97; ss by #8285, INTERIM, eff 2-21-05, EXPIRES: 8-20-05; ss by #8413, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10509, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13979, eff 5-24-24 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wr 100)",
